# .gitignore for ASP.NET Core + React project

# =====================
# ASP.NET Core
# =====================

## Build directories
bin/
obj/
out/
publish/

## VS Code workspace
.vs/
.vscode/

## User-specific files
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Rider IDE
.idea/

## NuGet packages
*.nupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/
!**/packages/repositories.config

## Entity Framework
*.db

## ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# =====================
# React / Node
# =====================

## Dependencies
node_modules/

## Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

## Lock files
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
.pnpmfile.cjs

## Production build
build/
dist/

## dotenv environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

## Misc
.DS_Store
coverage/
logs/
*.log

